        "grammar.wh_questions"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "क्या = What, कौन = Who, कहाँ = Where. ये सवाल वाले शब्द सबसे आगे आते हैं!",
        "hinglish": "Kya = What, kaun = Who, kahan = Where. Yeh sawaal waale shabd sabse aage aate hain!",
        "en": "What, Who and Where are question words. They come first in the question!"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L3.U14.S02",
      "skills": [
        "grammar.wh_questions"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "हिंदी: तुम्हारा नाम क्या है? इंग्लिश: What is your name? ‘What’ सबसे पहले!",
        "hinglish": "Hindi: Tumhara naam kya hai? English: What is your name? ‘What’ sabse pehle!",
        "en": "Compare: Tumhara naam kya hai? = What is your name? ‘What’ comes first!"
      }
    },
